      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ellisville\u2019s rise hinged on the Fulton County Narrow Gauge Railroad, which linked local farms to wider markets in the late 1800s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
